# Paths whose BYTES the team kit hashes. Git must hand them back exactly as they were committed:
# with `core.autocrlf=true` a fresh Windows clone rewrote two `.md` files of the hook bundle to
# CRLF, the recorded trust hash no longer matched, and every specialist spawn was refused
# (BUG-0316). `-text` turns line-ending conversion off for these paths in both directions.
.claude/hooks/** -text
.claude/kernel/** -text
# frozen design diagrams: their companion records the file's hash (`diagram_hash`)
*.drawio.svg -text
